3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["逛逛這間店也算一段時間了，畢竟中山站這附近的拉麵店真的很多，在滑google maps的時候滑到這間店看了一下評價以及菜單就決定以後要找時間過來吃吃看了。\n\n店的位置在二樓跟附近的拉麵店不太一樣，要稍微注意看才知道，上去之後門的右手邊有一台點餐機，點完之後找位子入座，就等餐點上桌吧。\n\n點了一碗特上醬油拉麵 NT$360 味道部分我覺得非常的不錯，還蠻好吃的，裡面除了叉燒之外還有一顆糖心蛋跟一片海苔以及餛飩，味道我覺得蠻特別的。算是近期吃到的拉麵，我覺得最好吃的。\n\n店裡面基本上都是賣拉麵啊沒有賣其他的東西叉燒飯那種都沒有，不過拉麵的味道，真的就蠻好吃的啦，還算蠻推的。",null,[0,142]]]],[],[null,null,18983,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aT09FMU9abk5SWlRoUFlrZ3dPWEp3VXpaRmRrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x6fbbb446e6960df6!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmZOOE1OZnNRZThPYkgwOXJwUzZFdkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aT09FMU9abk5SWlRoUFlrZ3dPWEp3VXpaRmRrRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aT09FMU9abk5SWlRoUFlrZ3dPWEp3VXpaRmRrRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aT09FMU9abk5SWlRoUFlrZ3dPWEp3VXpaRmRrRRILMGU2aGxWZWc0cDQaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tWk9PRTFPWm5OUlpUaFBZa2d3T1hKd1V6WkZka0USCzBlNmhsVmVnNHA0IhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR9g2W5ka0u28qCzBlNmhsVmVnNHA0\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwipzuju8tSWAxWWin0EHR_KByIQoykIYCgM"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjjiO7u8tSWAxVCeV4EHT3BIIcQ0pMFCAIoAA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwipzuju8tSWAxWWin0EHR_KByIQ0pMFCEsoAA"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WUFpTMXdPV1YwU201QmEwNTVOR3R1UVU1VlFXYxAB",["0x0:0x6fbbb446e6960df6",null,1782896769381922,1782896769381922,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110871574250927793074/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Alex Yang","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-BfB3Msx9I7xRaXcS1e5KpMyfRL8TpZ0xsSoCvI2p3veArQ\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110871574250927793074?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"110871574250927793074",null,1689,4777,null,[1,9,1],308,["在地嚮導 · 1689 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwipzuju8tSWAxWWin0EHR_KByIQpr8GCGIoAA"]]]],null,"2 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/bra